  The demo lakes, read with the samples off (DRISHTI_DEMO_ENABLED=false): every page reads the lakes, and nothing ticks. For
  tutorial 12 (live BI and boards) set DRISHTI_DEMO_ENABLED=true below: the demo source then ticks the live trades about twice a
  second (data/testdata/README.md, "The demo ticker").

  Offline mode (DRISHTI_OFFLINE=true): the server never reaches the internet. The news and yfinance connectors do not start (Admin,
  Connectors shows them "off (offline mode)"), and the news-and-markets quotes and headlines come from the captured snapshot that
  `drishti.py lake demo` builds into news/quote and news/news. Set it to false on a machine with internet to use the live connectors
  (when they are enabled).
